{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b228467b90fef1dd3e25cdc9f1c03539.poster.avif?t=1759915888\" width=640 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b228467b90fef1dd3e25cdc9f1c03539.webm?t=1759915888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/b228467b90fef1dd3e25cdc9f1c03539.mp4?t=1759915888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this darkly comedic RPG, you play as <strong>H.P. Lovecraft\u2019s  cat</strong>. Fed up with the horrendous\u00a0<i>name</i>\u00a0the family gave you. One day, you steal the <strong>Necronomicon</strong>, rip open a portal to <strong>2025 America</strong>, and buy a gun. Your mission? <strong>Kill racist Lovecraft in an act of r</strong>evenge,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the Necronomicon doesn\u2019t play fair. Every time you use it, it leaks eldritch horrors into the modern world. Now the streets are crawling with <strong>tentacled monstrosities</strong>, and <strong>cosmic abominations</strong>. If you're going to survive \u2014 let alone get strong enough to defeat your former master \u2014 you'll have to fight, adapt, and grow more powerful than anything Lovecraft ever imagined.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/5216d130781d4550690ecc32b384a284.poster.avif?t=1759915888\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/5216d130781d4550690ecc32b384a284.webm?t=1759915888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_